GhosterAI 3.3.5 local build — NOTICE

This package contains a local, key-free build of the GhosterAI desktop client
for Windows x64.

No API keys, account tokens or cloud credentials are included. The application
does not include a Ghoster account service, Supabase synchronization or Sentry
telemetry. The user supplies API keys at runtime; they are stored in the local
WebView2 profile as described in docs/API_KEYS.ru.md.

